Every item in ''[[Human Host]]'' rolls one of 6 quality tiers when it drops from loot or comes out of a workbench. Higher tiers hit harder, last longer, and are rarer. This page is the reference for the exact multipliers and the color codes the game paints on each item's inventory chip.

